(6915174, 1042532, 114225, '<td valign="top">This looks like a statue, which takes away the appeal to me. If this were a real person, I think you would have something nice.</td>', 'This looks like a statue, which takes away the appeal to me. If this were a real person, I think you would have something nice.', '2012-11-28 11:43:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915175, 1041820, 114225, '<td valign="top">The tones in this image are nice, and work well with the subject. I''m not a fan of the white vignette, it''s more of a distraction here than anything.</td>', 'The tones in this image are nice, and work well with the subject. I''m not a fan of the white vignette, it''s more of a distraction here than anything.', '2012-11-28 11:44:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915177, 1042228, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo, although it doesn''t say silence to me (due to the crashing waves). It''s interesting, I actually seem more visual silence in your "You''re doing it Wrong" entry.</td>', 'I really like this photo, although it doesn''t say silence to me (due to the crashing waves). It''s interesting, I actually seem more visual silence in your "You''re doing it Wrong" entry.', '2012-11-28 11:47:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915180, 1042460, 114225, '<td valign="top">Really nice composition. The noise in this photo detracts from the appeal a bit, but I still like it.</td>', 'Really nice composition. The noise in this photo detracts from the appeal a bit, but I still like it.', '2012-11-28 11:48:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915181, 1042397, 114225, '<td valign="top">Great choice in perspective. The lighting of the scene definitely says silence to me.</td>', 'Great choice in perspective. The lighting of the scene definitely says silence to me.', '2012-11-28 11:49:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915182, 1041930, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic in so many ways. My favorite for the challenge by far.</td>', 'This is fantastic in so many ways. My favorite for the challenge by far.', '2012-11-28 11:49:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915184, 1042520, 114225, '<td valign="top">Very nice image. The duo tone works well. The bent over grass indicates a strong wind to me, but maybe it''s jut heavy with seeds.</td>', 'Very nice image. The duo tone works well. The bent over grass indicates a strong wind to me, but maybe it''s jut heavy with seeds.', '2012-11-28 11:50:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915185, 1042534, 114225, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy what you did here. The emotion is striking.</td>', 'I really enjoy what you did here. The emotion is striking.', '2012-11-28 11:50:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915186, 1042113, 114225, '<td valign="top">The glassy water definitely show silence. It''s a fun reflection that almost makes the branches look like they have these leaves attached.</td>', 'The glassy water definitely show silence. It''s a fun reflection that almost makes the branches look like they have these leaves attached.', '2012-11-28 11:51:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915187, 1042513, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is a gorgeous photo. The colors, the clouds, and the moon add so much. It seems like there is a very strong wind blowing, which takes away from the silent feel somewhat.</td>', 'This is a gorgeous photo. The colors, the clouds, and the moon add so much. It seems like there is a very strong wind blowing, which takes away from the silent feel somewhat.', '2012-11-28 11:52:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915188, 1042498, 114225, '<td valign="top">The morning light really highlights this well. Seems like there is a soft focus effect that is simultaneously helping and hurting the image for me.</td>', 'The morning light really highlights this well. Seems like there is a soft focus effect that is simultaneously helping and hurting the image for me.', '2012-11-28 11:53:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915189, 1042492, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like this. Nothing like snow to dampen every sound that is made.</td>', 'I like this. Nothing like snow to dampen every sound that is made.', '2012-11-28 11:53:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915190, 1042139, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice. The green/brown/yellow works so well together.</td>', 'Nice. The green/brown/yellow works so well together.', '2012-11-28 11:54:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915240, 1042427, 54446, '<td valign="top">Someone else''s art.</td>', 'Someone else''s art.', '2012-11-28 13:45:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915284, 1042305, 114225, '<td valign="top">Nice details in the bird, although this doesn''t really say silence to me. I will give you the benefit of the doubt.</td>', 'Nice details in the bird, although this doesn''t really say silence to me. I will give you the benefit of the doubt.', '2012-11-28 15:45:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915285, 1042295, 114225, '<td valign="top">This image kind of creeps me out.</td>', 'This image kind of creeps me out.', '2012-11-28 15:46:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915286, 1042391, 114225, '<td valign="top">I like how there is a sliver of light coming in through the door openeing.</td>', 'I like how there is a sliver of light coming in through the door openeing.', '2012-11-28 15:46:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915287, 1041783, 114225, '<td valign="top">Anytime I can see cars in a city scene, quiet is the last thing that comes to mind.</td>', 'Anytime I can see cars in a city scene, quiet is the last thing that comes to mind.', '2012-11-28 15:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915288, 1042525, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m sure it was silent, but this doesn''t really have an impact to me.</td>', 'I''m sure it was silent, but this doesn''t really have an impact to me.', '2012-11-28 15:47:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915289, 1042424, 114225, '<td valign="top">Huh, using high key for silence, bold choice.</td>', 'Huh, using high key for silence, bold choice.', '2012-11-28 15:47:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915290, 1042490, 114225, '<td valign="top">This is really cute to see the bridge so much taller than the kid.</td>', 'This is really cute to see the bridge so much taller than the kid.', '2012-11-28 15:47:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915291, 1042159, 114225, '<td valign="top">The fall is indeed silent, but was about the landing?<br/> <br/>The B&amp;W is a nice choice here.</td>', 'The fall is indeed silent, but was about the landing? The B&W is a nice choice here.', '2012-11-28 15:48:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915293, 1042097, 114225, '<td valign="top">Ahhh, now I see. Took me a bit to find out it''s TP.<br/>The light adds to the silent feeling.</td>', 'Ahhh, now I see. Took me a bit to find out it''s TP.The light adds to the silent feeling.', '2012-11-28 15:48:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915294, 1042501, 114225, '<td valign="top">Interesting choice. When I see a moving creek I don''t often think silence, but this photo does seem to convey it.</td>', 'Interesting choice. When I see a moving creek I don''t often think silence, but this photo does seem to convey it.', '2012-11-28 15:49:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915300, 1042301, 114225, '<td valign="top">The energy in this is a mixture of calm and anticipation of the not-so-calm.</td>', 'The energy in this is a mixture of calm and anticipation of the not-so-calm.', '2012-11-28 15:54:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915303, 1042137, 114225, '<td valign="top">Funny, when I think of leaves on the ground, I think of the smells and the crunching sound as I walk on them. But lack of sound while watching the leaves is just as valid.</td>', 'Funny, when I think of leaves on the ground, I think of the smells and the crunching sound as I walk on them. But lack of sound while watching the leaves is just as valid.', '2012-11-28 15:55:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915304, 1042308, 114225, '<td valign="top">Until that canon goes off! That should wake up the neighbors.</td>', 'Until that canon goes off! That should wake up the neighbors.', '2012-11-28 15:55:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915306, 1042377, 114225, '<td valign="top">The quiet end of a fall day. This image is fine, but doesn''t have the pop that others have.</td>', 'The quiet end of a fall day. This image is fine, but doesn''t have the pop that others have.', '2012-11-28 15:56:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915307, 1042289, 114225, '<td valign="top">The photo itself has good mood in it, and is creative. I really dislike almost every use of selective saturation, and unfortunately, this one is no different.</td>', 'The photo itself has good mood in it, and is creative. I really dislike almost every use of selective saturation, and unfortunately, this one is no different.', '2012-11-28 15:57:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915309, 1042472, 114225, '<td valign="top">I find myself wondering how the chair was busted. Must have been a ruckus game.</td>', 'I find myself wondering how the chair was busted. Must have been a ruckus game.', '2012-11-28 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915311, 1042516, 114225, '<td valign="top">To me, this photo has too many subjects. Nothing to really focus in on.</td>', 'To me, this photo has too many subjects. Nothing to really focus in on.', '2012-11-28 15:58:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915312, 1042231, 114225, '<td valign="top">The quiet morning walk, I love when that is the start to my day.</td>', 'The quiet morning walk, I love when that is the start to my day.', '2012-11-28 15:58:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(6915313, 1042380, 114225, '<td valign="top">I''m not sure I understand this. The toys are indeed silent, but they don''t convey silence to me.</td>', 'I''m not sure I understand this. The toys are indeed silent, but they don''t convey silence to me.', '2012-11-28 15:59:19.000000', NULL, 1),
