(6920715, 1042512, 12611, '<td valign="top">A nice shot, a street style candid and much different than the others at the top, and in many ways, thats a good thing. The glaring light, the floor and wall patterns, they all contrast perfectly with that "Payne''s Grey" color of the chairs and the shadows. The movement in the still figure caps it off, with the two lampshades like arrows lifting the eye upward. Great work Mark.</td>', 'A nice shot, a street style candid and much different than the others at the top, and in many ways, thats a good thing. The glaring light, the floor and wall patterns, they all contrast perfectly with that "Payne''s Grey" color of the chairs and the shadows. The movement in the still figure caps it off, with the two lampshades like arrows lifting the eye upward. Great work Mark.', '2012-12-03 08:40:05.000000', NULL, 0),
