(6921231, 1042516, 124190, '<td valign="top">Hey.....so he''s not whispering......so what. He''s looking.  OK&gt;!  My friend says he''s a member of the Fugawe tribe........where the Fugawe live? HAHAHA. That''s why he''s looking.....and that is not politically incorrect as I am in complete disgust of how the Indians have been treated in their native lands by the invading settlers...... Actually you are right, it is the Mercer Museum and I want to camp there for a week.   See what else you may recognize...around the challenges......where''s Waldo.....type thing!   fun.<br/>Actually, seriously the collection of Lenape Indian artifacts is beyond belief and the whole place is so haunted I felt like I was floating!!!!!!!!!!!!December 8 they have an open house at the Mercer Castle.</td>', 'Hey.....so he''s not whispering......so what. He''s looking.  OK>!  My friend says he''s a member of the Fugawe tribe........where the Fugawe live? HAHAHA. That''s why he''s looking.....and that is not politically incorrect as I am in complete disgust of how the Indians have been treated in their native lands by the invading settlers...... Actually you are right, it is the Mercer Museum and I want to camp there for a week.   See what else you may recognize...around the challenges......where''s Waldo.....type thing!   fun.Actually, seriously the collection of Lenape Indian artifacts is beyond belief and the whole place is so haunted I felt like I was floating!!!!!!!!!!!!December 8 they have an open house at the Mercer Castle.', '2012-12-03 14:11:10.000000', NULL, 0),
